1, 2
, Alessandra Narcisi
1, 2
1
IRCCS Humanitas Research Hospital, Dermatology Unit, Rozzano 
(
MI
)
, Italy
2
Humanitas University, Department of Biomedical Sciences, Pieve Emanuele 
(
MI
)
, Italy
3
Policlinico of Milan, Milano, Italy
4
Università degli Studi di Brescia - Facoltà di Medicina e Chirurgia -, Brescia, Italy
5
University of Turin, Torino, Italy
