Real-world Effectiveness by Body Regions and Safety of Upadacitinib in Canadian Adult Patients With
Atopic Dermatitis who Were Inadequate Responders or Intolerant to Dupilumab: Results From the
CAN UpTIMISE Study
Vimal H. Prajapati*
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6
, Melinda J. Gooderham
