Dupilumab treatment is not associated with changes  in lymphoma risk in atopic dermatitis and other type
2 inflammatory diseases: Data from a large-scale retrospective cohort study
Khalaf Kridin
1
, Bieber Katja
2
, Henning Olbrich
3
