Abstract N°: 2977
Real-world effectiveness and safety of every-four-week lebrikizumab maintenance dosing  from Week 4
following two loading doses in Japanese patients with atopic dermatitis
Yoshiki Okada
1
, Masahiro Kamata
1
, Shoya Suzuki
1
, Ayu Watanabe
1
, Chika Chijiwa
1
, Ryosuke Takeshima
1
, Azusa
Hiura
