Abstract N°: 3690
Design and Rationale of ARMADA-AD Disease Registry: An International, Prospective, Observational
Registry to Characterize Unmet Needs and Evaluate Real-World Effectiveness and Safety of Systemic
Therapies in Adults and Adolescents with Atopic Dermatitis
Raj Chovatiya
1, 2
, Bob Geng
3, 4
, Thomas Bieber
5
, Linda Stein Gold
6
, Diamant Thaçi
7
, Moataz Daoud
8
, Kassim
Rahawi
