Effectiveness and Achievement of Minimal Disease Activity with Upadacitinib in Adults and Adolescents
With Atopic Dermatitis: 12-Month Interim Analysis of the Real-World Multicountry AD-VISE Study
José-Juan Pereyra-Rodriguez*
1, 2
, Parbeer Grewal
