Efficacy and Safety of OX40-Receptor Targeting With Rocatinlimab in Moderate-to-Severe Atopic
Dermatitis: Results From the Phase 3 ROCKET-Ignite Trial
Emma Guttman-Yassky* , Emma Guttman-Yassky
