School of Medicine, Trinity College Dublin, Dublin, Ireland
2
Department of Dermatology, Northwestern University Feinberg School of Medicine, Chicago, United States
3
Ann & Robert H. Lurie Children
’
s Hospital, Chicago, United States
4
Department of Pediatrics, Saint Louis University, St. Louis, United States
5
Cardinal Glennon Children
’
s Hospital, St. Louis, United States
6
Department of Infection, Immunity and Cardiovascular Disease, Sheffield Dermatology Research, University of
Sheffield, Sheffield, United Kingdom
7
Sheffield Children
’
s Hospital, Sheffield, United Kingdom
8
