Effectiveness, Patient-reported Outcomes, and Safety of Upadacitinib in Canadian Adult Patients With
Atopic Dermatitis who Were Inadequate Responders or Intolerant to Dupilumab: Results from the
CAN UpTIMISE Study
H. Chih-ho Hong*
1, 2, 3
, Charles W. Lynde
4, 5, 6
, Fiona Lovegrove
