Dr. Chih-ho Hong Medical Inc., Surrey, Canada
3
Probity Medical Research, Surrey, Canada
4
University of Toronto, Division of Dermatology, Temerty Faculty of Medicine, Toronto, Canada
5
The Lynde Institute for Dermatology & Lynderm Research Inc., Markham, Canada
6
Probity Medical Research Inc., Waterloo, Canada
7
