, Arnau Domenech
9
, Stephan Weidinger
10
1
Dermatology Centre, Northern Care Alliance NHS Foundation Trust & Division of Musculoskeletal and
Dermatological Sciences Manchester Academic Health Science Centre, University of Manchester, Manchester,
United Kingdom
2
Division of Dermatology, Venereology and Clinical Immunology, Faculty of Medicine, Wroc
ł
aw University of
Science and Technology, Wroc
ł
aw, Poland
3
Department of Dermatology and Allergology, University Medical Center Utrecht, Utrecht, Netherlands
4
Department of Dermatology, Fachklinik Bad Bentheim, Bad Bentheim, Germany
5
Dermatologie, Polyclinique Saint George - Groupe Kantys, Nice, France
