combination with topical corticosteroids provides rapid and sustained improvement in SCORAD outcomes. We
expand these findings by reporting the proportion of patients achieving and maintaining low disease activity, as
measured by total SCORAD, in patients with moderate-to-severe AD receiving 1 year of dupilumab monotherapy
across multiple dose regimens.
Materials & Methods:
 In this post hoc analysis, 183 adults with moderate-to-severe AD who received dupilumab
300 mg q2w in the LIBERTY AD SOLO 1/2 trials 
(
NCT02277743/NCT02277769
)
 and achieved an optimal response
of Investigator
