 At baseline of SOLO 1/2, 99% of patients had moderate 
(
81%
)
 or severe 
(
18%
)
 AD as measured by
SCORAD 
(
Figure
)
. Rapid improvement was observed after 4 weeks of dupilumab q2w; 62% of patients had mild,
almost clear, or clear AD at Week 4 and most patients had improved by 
≥
1 severity category from baseline. At
Week 16, 96% of patients had mild, almost clear, or clear disease, which was maintained up to 1 year by most
patients 
(
92%
)
 continuing dupilumab q2w treatment to Week 52 and those switching to dupilumab q4w 
(
92%
)
 or
q8w 
(
