Abstract N°: 6297
Similar Patient Profiles and High Early Persistence Rates of Abrocitinib Among Adolescents and Adults
with Moderate-to-Severe Atopic Dermatitis: A Real-World U.S. Analysis
Lawrence Eichenfield
1
, Meera R Gupta
2, 3
, Andrew Rava
