)
, or 300 mg q2w 
(≥
60 kg
)
. Topical treatments were
allowed. Race was self-reported and patients stratified into 2 subgroups for this analysis: White vs Asian,
Black/African American, or Other. Changes in Children
’
s Dermatology Life Quality Index 
(
