Abstract N°: 6513
Effectiveness of 12-months tralokinumab treatment in 654 adults with atopic dermatitis with head & neck
area involvement: Final real-world data from the prospective, non-interventional, international, single-
cohort TRACE study
Diamant Thaçi* , Marni Wiseman
