Abstract N°: 6707
Treatment with delgocitinib cream is associated with a reduction of Staphylococcus aureus density and
pain in patients with mild to severe Chronic Hand Eczema
Tove Agner*
1
, Derya Aytan-Aktug
2
, James Greig
