)
, REGIMEN 
(
NCT03627767
)
, COMPARE 
(
NCT03720470
)
, TEEN 
(
NCT03796676
)
, MOA
(
NCT03915496
)
, and DARE 
(
NCT04345367
)
 trials and subsequently enrolled in the ongoing extension study, JADE
EXTEND 
(
NCT03422822; data cutoff: 5 September 2022
)
 and achieved response criteria 
(
Investigator
’
s Global
Assessment score of 0 or 1 with 
≥
