Abstract N°: 7424
Efficacy and safety of ruxolitinib cream monotherapy for atopic dermatitis: An updated systematic review
and meta-analysis of randomized vehicle-controlled trials with trial sequential analysis
Laura Ghanem*
1
, Daniela Lucía Mendoza-Millán
2, 3
, Bárbara Baptista Lopes
4
, Martin Cevallos-Cueva
5
, Devanie
Martani
