7, 8
, Virginia Velasco-Tamariz
9
, Peter Chien
2, 3
1
Faculty of Medical Sciences, Lebanese University, Beirut, Lebanon
2
Department of Dermatology, Harvard Medical School, Boston, Massachusetts, United States
3
Department of Dermatology, Beth Israel Deaconess Medical Center, Boston, Massachusetts, United States
4
Faculty of Medicine, Faculdade de Filosofia, Ciências e Letras de Penápolis, São Paulo, Brazil
5
School of Medicine, Universidad Central del Ecuador, Quito, Ecuador
6
