Nemolizumab long-term safety and efficacy up to 104 weeks in ARCADIA open-label extension study in
adolescents and adults with moderate-to-severe atopic dermatitis.
Jonathan I. Silverberg
1
, Diamant Thaçi
2
, Marie Tauber
3, 4
, Linda Stein Gold
