9
1
Dermatology Centre, Salford Care Organisation, part of the Northern Care Alliance NHS Foundation Trust,
Manchester National Institute for Health Research Biomedical Research Centre, The University of Manchester,
United Kingdom, and the Medicines Evaluation Unit, Manchester, United Kingdom
2
Centre for Human Drug Research, Leiden, Netherlands; Leiden University Medical Centre, Leiden University,
Leiden, Netherlands
