First evidence for the utility of the novel 
“
Patient-Reported Impact of Dermatological Diseases
”
 
(
PRIDD
)
as a patient-centered tool in the development of a new emollient Plus for atopic dermatitis
Marine Rodeghiero
1
, Gautier Doat
