Abstract N°: 8294
Real-world effectiveness and safety of abrocitinib, baricitinib and upadacitinib in atopic dermatitis: A
systematic review and meta-analysis
Amalie Thorsti Møller Rønnstad
1
, Daniel Isufi
2
, Christopher Bunick
