, Jacob Thyssen
1
, Nikolai Loft*
2
1
Bispebjerg Hospital, Department of Dermatology, Copenhagen, Denmark
2
Copenhagen University Hospital - Herlev and Gentofte, Department of Dermatology and Allergy, Copenhagen,
Denmark
3
Yale School of Medicine, Department of Dermatology and Program in Translational Biomedicine, New Haven,
United States
4
