Abstract N°: 8466
Latest Research Hot Spots of Atopic Dermatitis Management Using Janus Kinase Inhibitor: A Bibliometric
Analysis and Visualized Review
Houriah Nukaly
1
, Zeinah Alhalees
2
1
McGill University, Montreal, Canada
