Abstract N°: 8498
Adverse events following systemic therapy targeting the immune system in patients with atopic dermatitis
Kathrin Thormann
1
, Charlotte Arms
1
, Simone Cazzaniga
1
, Zora Martignoni
1
, Mathias Lehmann
1
